From f666bd35f2d768d4fac4f14ea15535e1603873ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:39:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 857/913] module: optee_clock: check elt_id_to_ctx() for NULL
 in element_init
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

optee_clock_element_init() dereferenced the result of
elt_id_to_ctx() without checking for NULL, unlike 7 of the other 8
call sites in this file, causing a NULL pointer dereference for an
invalid element_id.

Return FWK_E_PARAM when ctx is NULL.

Coverity issue: CID 1200286: CERT-C Expression

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git bb093f0c06a6574a14a379441482d1372d06cfe7 module: optee_clock: check elt_id_to_ctx() for NULL in element_init]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I4f3dd949d241d7049aa68ca06e1c520856aeb663
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/SCP-firmware/+/592832
Reviewed-by: Valentin CARON <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 .../product/optee/common/module/clock/src/mod_optee_clock.c   | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/common/module/clock/src/mod_optee_clock.c b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/common/module/clock/src/mod_optee_clock.c
index 1e41128e7..661e29d91 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/common/module/clock/src/mod_optee_clock.c
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/SCP-firmware/product/optee/common/module/clock/src/mod_optee_clock.c
@@ -410,6 +410,10 @@ static int optee_clock_element_init(
     const struct mod_optee_clock_config *config = data;
     TEE_Result res;
 
+    if (ctx == NULL) {
+        return FWK_E_PARAM;
+    }
+
     ctx->clk = config->clk;
     if (ctx->clk) {
         ctx->enabled = config->default_enabled;
-- 
2.53.0

